women with breast cancer before pregnancy.</p></fn><fn id="tbfnote12"><label/><p>Group 2: Mean birth weight for newborns of women diagnosed with breast cancer during pregnancy.</p></fn><fn id="tbfnote13"><label/><p>Group 3: Mean birth weight for newborns of women with breast cancer from the day after giving birth until 2 years post partum.</p></fn><fn id="tbfnote14"><label>a</label><p>Adjusted for gestational age (20&#x02013;33 week, 34&#x02013;36 week and &#x02a7e;37 week), mother's age (&#x0003c;25 year, 25&#x02013;29 year, 30&#x02013;34 year, &#x02a7e;35 year), parity (1, 2&#x0002b;) and calendar period for birth (73&#x02013;86, 87&#x02013;94, 95&#x02013;02) in a multivariate regression model.</p></fn><fn id="tbfnote15"><label>b</label><p>Stillborn babies were excluded from the analysis.</p></fn></table-wrap-foot></table-wrap></floats-wrap></article>